sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Dashboard or Stops page
    participant SC as Stops Controller
    participant ST as SQL table: stops
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Select period/team or selected day
    UI->>SC: Request downtime by cause
    SC->>ST: Group stop duration by cause
    SC->>CA: Join cause names
    ST-->>SC: Downtime totals by cause_id
    CA-->>SC: Cause labels
    SC-->>UI: Downtime-by-cause series
    UI-->>Admin: Display downtime chart

    alt No downtime or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show empty chart or error message
    end
